<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Inspection Scheduled</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #1E293B;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #F8FAFC;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #00A3FF;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.025em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px;
        }
        .address-box {
            background-color: #F1F5F9;
            padding: 24px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            border-left: 4px solid #00A3FF;
        }
        .address-box h2 {
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #64748B;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }
        .address-box p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0F172A;
        }
        .details-grid {
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }
        .detail-item {
            display: flex;
            padding: 12px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #F1F5F9;
        }
        .detail-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            width: 120px;
            color: #64748B;
            font-size: 13px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.025em;
        }
        .detail-value {
            flex: 1;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #1E293B;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .footer {
            padding: 20px 40px;
            background-color: #F8FAFC;
            border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #94A3B8;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #00A3FF;
            color: #FFFFFF !important;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background-color: #E2E8F0;
            margin: 32px 0;
        }
        .hint {
            font-size: 13px; 
            color: #64748B;
            background: #F8FAFC;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin-top: 24px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Appointment Confirmed</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello <strong>{{client_name}}</strong>,</p>
            <p>This email is to confirm that your home inspection has been officially scheduled. Our team is ready to provide a thorough evaluation of the property.</p>
            
            <div class="address-box">
                <h2>Property Address</h2>
                <p>{{address}}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="details-grid">
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <span class="detail-label">Date & Time</span>
                    <span class="detail-value">{{date}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <span class="detail-label">Inspection Fee</span>
                    <span class="detail-value">{{price}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <span class="detail-label">Inspector</span>
                    <span class="detail-value">{{inspector_name}}</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="hint">
                <strong>Important:</strong> Please ensure all utilities are active and that the inspector has full access to the attic, crawlspace, and electrical panels.
            </div>

            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="#" class="btn">Add to Calendar</a>
            </div>

            <div class="divider"></div>
            
            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748B;">If you need to reschedule or have any questions, please contact us directly. We look forward to serving you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            &copy; 2026 Home Inspection Management App. All rights reserved.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
